[[16,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3025751\">7025A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025752\">7025A14</a></p>"],[16,63,0,"<p><a href=\"#/3025483\">5505A28</a></p><p>1. Check that the negative battery terminal is not disconnected.</p><p>2. Disconnect the electrical earth lead at the negative battery\nterminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3023729\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Disconnect the electrical earth connection at the chassis.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Battery earth on bodyshell</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>C3A</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p>4. Disconnect the electrical earth connection on the power unit.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>Battery earth on engine</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3023843\">C2</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>5. Remove the battery earth lead.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2004979.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the battery earth\nlead is not damaged and that the individual conductors are firmly\nattached to the connections.</p><p>If necessary, check the continuity.</p><p>Position the battery earth lead.</p><p>Connect the earth connection to the power\nunit.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>EARTH ON POWER UNIT</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.5</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the earth connection on the bodyshell.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>EARTH ON BODYSHELL</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>2.4</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the cable to the negative battery\nterminal.</p><p><a href=\"#/3025483\">5505A28</a></p>"],[16,63,0,"<p><a href=\"#/3025752\">7025A14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025751\">7025A12</a></p>"]]